---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | NYCUNO"
  description="Read NYCUNO's Terms and Conditions."
  currentPage="Terms & Conditions"
>
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-site flex-1 px-4 py-12.5 sm:px-6">
    <section>
      <h1
        class="relative mb-7 pb-5 font-sans text-[35px] font-medium leading-none text-brand after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-[50px] after:bg-brand"
        data-reveal="up"
      >
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-base font-normal leading-[26px] text-[#404040]">
        <p data-reveal="up">
          Welcome to nycuno, a cutting-edge platform connecting users with a
          various services, designed to enhance your convenience and lifestyle.
          nycuno aims to provide an efficient and seamless experience, and by
          using the nycuno application ("the App"), You are consenting to be
          bound by these T&Cs. It is essential to thoroughly review and
          understand the following T&Cs, as they govern your use of the App.
          Please refrain from using the App if you do not agree with any part
          of these T&Cs.
        </p>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            1. User Eligibility
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li data-reveal="up">
              To utilize nycuno, you must be at least 18 years old and capable
              of entering into a legally binding agreement. By accessing and
              using the App, you confirm that you meet these eligibility
              criteria.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            2. User Accounts
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li data-reveal="up">
              Access to nycuno's services requires the creation of a user
              account. Users are responsible for providing accurate and complete
              information during the registration process.
            </li>
            <li data-reveal="up">
              Safeguard your account credentials, and immediately report any
              unauthorized access to nycuno.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            3. Service Description
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li data-reveal="up">
              nycuno operates as a comprehensive platform connecting users with
              diverse services.
            </li>
            <li data-reveal="up">
              Users have the ability to request various services through the
              user-friendly interface of the App.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            4. Pricing and Payment
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li data-reveal="up">
              Users agree to pay the fees presented on the App for the
              requested services.
            </li>
            <li data-reveal="up">
              Payment methods, including credit cards and digital wallets, are
              processed securely through the App.
            </li>
            <li data-reveal="up">
              Additional fees may be applied for specific circumstances, such
              as cancellations or any other charges.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            5. Cancellations and Refunds
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li data-reveal="up">
              Users have the right to cancel services, subject to applicable
              conditions & cancellation fees.
            </li>
            <li data-reveal="up">
              Refunds for completed services are at the discretion of nycuno.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            6. Conduct Guidelines
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li data-reveal="up">
              Users are expected to treat their service partners and fellow
              users with respect and courtesy.
            </li>
            <li data-reveal="up">
              Prohibited behavior includes discrimination, harassment, and any
              violations of applicable laws.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            7. Privacy Policy
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li data-reveal="up">
              nycuno collects and processes user data in accordance with its
              Privacy Policy, compliant with privacy laws.
            </li>
            <li data-reveal="up">
              By using the App, you consent to the collection and use of your
              information as outlined in the Privacy Policy.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            8. Intellectual Property
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li data-reveal="up">
              nycuno retains ownership of all intellectual property related to
              the App.
            </li>
            <li data-reveal="up">
              Users are granted a limited, non-exclusive, revocable license to
              use the App.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            9. Limitation of Liability
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li data-reveal="up">
              nycuno is not liable for direct, indirect, incidental, or
              consequential damages arising from App use or services provided,
              to the extent permitted by law.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            10. Governing Law
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li data-reveal="up">
              These terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the
              laws.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-text" data-reveal="up">
            11. Modifications
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li data-reveal="up">
              nycuno reserves the right to modify these terms at any time.
              Users will be notified of any changes.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <p data-reveal="up">
          By using nycuno, you acknowledge having read, understood, and agreed
          to these T&Cs.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
